OL,3,GNEWSADouble killer denies attack on
OL,4,Aprison officer
OL,5,
OL,6,FDouble killer Simon Levy has denied
OL,7,Fallegations that he stabbed a prison
OL,8,Fofficer with a pen and tried to
OL,9,Fstrangle him at HMP Belmarsh.
OL,11,FThe 41-year-old, who is serving a
OL,12,Fwhole-life sentence for the murder of
OL,13,Ftwo women and the violent rape of a
OL,14,Fthird woman, is charged with assault
OL,15,Foccasioning actual bodily harm and
OL,16,Fintentional strangulation.
OL,18,FThe alleged incident took place whilst
OL,19,FLevy, formerly of Tottenham, north
OL,20,FLondon, was being held on remand on 18
OL,21,FFebruary.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
